Create the Required Databases
Your microservices expect separate databases for proper data isolation. You can create them easily right inside pgAdmin:
In the left sidebar, click the arrow next to PostgreSQL 18 to expand it.   
Right-click on Databases (or the server itself) -> select Create -> Database...   Name your database (e.g., user_db) and click Save.
Repeat this process to create the other databases your services need:product_dborder_dbpayment_db
(Note: The cart_db is optional since you are using Redis for cart caching, but you can create one if needed).


